<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title> CSS Fonts, Styles and Backgrounds</title>
<style>
  
  body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background-image: url("https://picsum.photos/1200/800");
    background-size: cover;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000;
  }

  .heading2 {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: darkred;
    font-style: italic;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  p.normal {
    font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #222;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  p.fancy {
    font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: navy;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  #highlight {
    font-family: "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif;
    color: white;
    background-color: darkgreen;
    padding: 4px 10px;
  }

  .content {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    padding: 15px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  
  .box1, .box2 {
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    padding: 40px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px #000;
  }

  .box1 {
    background-image: url("https://picsum.photos/id/237/600/300");
    color: white;
  }

  .box2 {
    background-image: url("https://picsum.photos/id/10/600/300");
    color: yellow;
    border: 3px solid white;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1> CSS Fonts, Styles and Backgrounds</h1>

  <div class="content">
    <h2 class="heading2">Different fonts and styles</h2>
    <p class="normal">This paragraph uses the Verdana font with a custom line height.</p>
    <p class="fancy">Bold, uppercase and letter-spaced text</p>
    <p>Here is <span id="highlight">highlighted text</span> using an ID selector.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="box1">This element has its own background image</div>
  <div class="box2">This element has a different background image</div>
 <footer>
   Created by <span> RASHI YADAV </span> | Roll no. <span> 2501920110297</span>     
    </footer>



</body>
</html>
